  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"FMWCN\" id=\"FMWCN\"><span data-lake-id=\"u13d07a01\" id=\"u13d07a01\">学习目标</span></h2><ol list=\"u19a07661\"><li fid=\"uc87a59ce\" data-lake-id=\"ud4715352\" id=\"ud4715352\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5e002c7c\" id=\"u5e002c7c\">理解模数转换器（ADC）的基本原理和应用场景；</span></li><li fid=\"uc87a59ce\" data-lake-id=\"u3a410dd0\" id=\"u3a410dd0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud0d4ce41\" id=\"ud0d4ce41\">掌握STC8H中ADC模块的结构和工作原理；</span></li><li fid=\"uc87a59ce\" data-lake-id=\"u334efb8b\" id=\"u334efb8b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue5dfbc97\" id=\"ue5dfbc97\">学会使用STC8H的ADC的电路设计；</span></li><li fid=\"uc87a59ce\" data-lake-id=\"u41aa27ce\" id=\"u41aa27ce\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3d21fc7e\" id=\"u3d21fc7e\">掌握通过编程获取ADC数据</span></li><li fid=\"uc87a59ce\" data-lake-id=\"ube9a785f\" id=\"ube9a785f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1839dff2\" id=\"u1839dff2\">学会基本的调试策略</span></li></ol><h2 data-lake-id=\"wzGvq\" id=\"wzGvq\"><span data-lake-id=\"u17099e67\" id=\"u17099e67\">学习内容</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"eVZMx\" id=\"eVZMx\"><span data-lake-id=\"u14584cd5\" id=\"u14584cd5\">案例介绍</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u93924457\" id=\"u93924457\"><span data-lake-id=\"u932af1a9\" id=\"u932af1a9\">通过控制滑动变阻器，来观察电压变化。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u361c11bf\" id=\"u361c11bf\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1760953647359-040842ee-1c3e-4816-8159-12419df9ea55.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fwatermark%252Ctype_d3F5LW1pY3JvaGVp%252Csize_14%252Ctext_6buR6ams56iL5bqP5ZGY%252Ccolor_FFFFFF%252Cshadow_50%252Ct_80%252Cg_se%252Cx_10%252Cy_10%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u5a6d9f31-2adc-4f07-9994-6932f6bcf99%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u48cc26a4-09e2-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A327.8000183105469%2C