s%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22l5hLG%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uf89928f8\" id=\"uf89928f8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub98825f9\" id=\"ub98825f9\">芯片基准电压，参考</span><code data-lake-id=\"u1b3b72e9\" id=\"u1b3b72e9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u08fd87fb\" id=\"u08fd87fb\">ADC_VRef+</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3c304fbe\" id=\"u3c304fbe\">引脚，此引脚设计如下：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub13d12a6\" id=\"ub13d12a6\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1688957505145-af853232-8b4e-42dd-9bb5-22912b76ab95.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fwatermark%252Ctype_d3F5LW1pY3JvaGVp%252Csize_10%252Ctext_6buR6ams56iL5bqP5ZGY%252Ccolor_FFFFFF%252Cshadow_50%252Ct_80%252Cg_se%252Cx_10%252Cy_10%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ub44b59fa-d02f-4ae9-9e57-dab9b29dfac%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ue9230a8b-ec27-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A327.2727201792821%2C%22height%22%3A445%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A28992%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A360%2C%22originHeight%22%3A490%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.100000023841858%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9F%BA%E5%87%86%E7%94%B5%E5%8E%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A60%2C%22y%22%3A2%2C%22width%22%3A298%2C%22height%22%3A77%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R%E6%9C%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A155%2C%22y%22%3A305%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%89C6%22%2C%22x%22%3A249%2C%22y%22%3A315%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%225100%22%2C%22x%22%3A200%2C%22y%22%3A206%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VREF%22%2C%22x%22%3A53%2C%22y%22%3A306%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GND%22%2C%22x%22%3A174%2C%22y%22%3A445%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22100NF%22%2C%22x%22%3A255%2C%22y%22%3A335%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22C3113%22%2C%22x%22%3A114%2C%22y%22%3A376%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%8E%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A183%2C%22y%22%3A133%2C%22width%22%3A22%2C%22height%22%3A80%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%223V3%22%2C%22x%22%3A176%2C%22y%22%3A126%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R1%22%2C%22x%22%3A211%2C%22y%22%3A186%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A175%2C%22y%22%3A359%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A105%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f1efef%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BJgNV%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3aed3968\" id=\"u3aed3968\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2b59e65e\" id=\"u2b59e65e\">ADC为12位精度的，意思是最大值是2的12次方，值为4096.</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uecef395d\" id=\"uecef395d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud1d185c2\" id=\"ud1d185c2\">ADC的这个最大值，表示的是最大测量范围：</span></p><ol list=\"u5d424aa9\"><li fid=\"u33c49975\" data-lake-id=\"u0b1888ff\" id=\"u0b1888ff\"><span data-lake-id=\"ued4e9643\" id=\"ued4e9643\">数值最大为4096</span></li><li fid=\"u33c49975\" data-lake-id=\"uc9087163\" id=\"uc9087163\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7756624e\" id=\"u7756624e\">测量的电压值不能超过基准电压</span></li><li fid=\"u33c49975\" data-lake-id=\"u4ef8c185\" id=\"u4ef8c185\"><span data-lake-id=\"u11290a62\" id=\"u11290a62\">基准电压对应的值为4096</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"ubcf1f709\" id=\"ubcf1f709\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua240e641\" id=\"ua240e641\">记住：我们用4096表示基准电压。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u066239a2\" id=\"u066239a2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5a8674f6\" id=\"u5a8674f6\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3b0c9797\" id=\"u3b0c9797\"><span data-lake-id=\"u68c053d6\" id=\"u68c053d6\">以上原理图中，基准电压由 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u76df8922\" id=\"u76df8922\"><span data-lake-id=\"u43eb79b8\" id=\"u43eb79b8\">VREF</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u02d2912f\" id=\"u02d2912f\">电压决定。这个电路中用到了一个芯片</span><code data-lake-id=\"uc278b368\" id=\"uc278b368\"><span data-lake-id=\"uce485985\" id=\"uce485985\">CJ431/CD431</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ucd7fe43d\" id=\"ucd7fe43d\">，这是一款电压基准芯片，会恒定的输出</span><code data-lake-id=\"ue51e42fb\" id=\"ue51e42fb\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud95d9bc8\" id=\"ud95d9bc8\">2.5V</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u22df8183\" id=\"u22df8183\">电压。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9c35a49e\" id=\"u9c35a49e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u21fe985f\" id=\"u21fe985f\">在我们的设计方案中，理论上可以不使用这个电压基准芯片的，直接连接3V3，但是LDO的输出稳定性不够，因此使用电压基准芯片会更为准确。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u239ceeeb\" id=\"u239ceeeb\"><span data-lake-id=\"uec1ee975\" id=\"uec1ee975\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0c6303dc\" id=\"u0c6303dc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u27ee24ad\" id=\"u27ee24ad\">由以上我们可以得出：</span></p><ol list=\"ufe8223ff\"><li fid=\"ubff768a8\" data-lake-id=\"ue3bee351\" id=\"ue3bee351\"><span data-lake-id=\"u375fc03e\" id=\"u375fc03e\">基准电压为：2.5V</span></li><li fid=\"ubff768a8\" data-lake-id=\"u2ff4d74c\" id=\"u2ff4d74c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5b1c7af5\" id=\"u5b1c7af5\">基准电压对应的数值是4096</span></li><li fid=\"ubff768a8\" data-lake-id=\"u0dc6b9dd\" id=\"u0dc6b9dd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5486fc9f\" id=\"u5486fc9f\">测量的值为ADC引脚</span></li><li fid=\"ubff768a8\" data-lake-id=\"u6a1bf7ee\" id=\"u6a1bf7ee\"><span data-lake-id=\"u37fd1c8a\" id=\"u37fd1c8a\">电压值的计算：</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u3fcf8f03\" id=\"u3fcf8f03\" style=\"padding-left: 2em\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"math\" value=\"data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%E7%94%B5%E5%8E%8B%E5%80%BC%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%E6%B5%8B%E9%87%8F%E5%80%BC%20*%20%E5%9F%BA%E5%87%86%E7%94%B5%E5%8E%8B%7D%7B4096%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa9fdec847b4ac4bff733550e8e13dca3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cNZqg%22%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua287bce6\" id=\"ua287bce6\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"kwKrd\" id=\"kwKrd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u260332b3\" id=\"u260332b3\">反向得到电源输入电压(了解)</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u9d9cfbf9\" id=\"u9d9cfbf9\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ucbb555a6\" id=\"ucbb555a6\">根据内部1.19V参考电压，反向计算参考电压</span></strong></p><ol list=\"u4b7c01a5\"><li fid=\"uf5ee7361\" data-lake-id=\"uad4328d8\" id=\"uad4328d8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0a5830f2\" id=\"u0a5830f2\">将ADC_Vref+引脚接到VCC管脚</span></li><li fid=\"uf5ee7361\" data-lake-id=\"ua3faa2ff\" id=\"ua3faa2ff\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua9f7fde8\" id=\"ua9f7fde8\">MCU_Vcc = 4096 * 1.19V / 12位ADC转换结果(CH15)</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"ua1f2af35\" id=\"ua1f2af35\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua6637f76\" id=\"ua6637f76\">​</span><card type=\"inline\" name=\"math\" value=\"data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B1.19V%7D%7BV_%7Bref%7D%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7BADC15%5C%5C_Value%7D%7B4096%7D%5Cn%5C%5C%5C%5C%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20%5CnVcc%20%3D%20V_%7Bref%7D%20%26%3D%20%20%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1.19V%20%5C%5Ctimes%204096%7D%7BADC15%5C%5C_Value%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F37d0cfca9b450633c9eb65f50f10761b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22azdBK%22%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufc71ca9c\" id=\"ufc71ca9c\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uaa1c5783\" id=\"uaa1c5783\">测量标定</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u491fc718\" id=\"u491fc718\"><span data-lake-id=\"u461f7e30\" id=\"u461f7e30\">可外接精准参考信号源，然后利用 ADC 的第 15通道进行测量标定</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u19ceec87\" id=\"u19ceec87\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"math\" value=\"data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7Bx%7D%7BV_%7Bref%7D%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7BADC15%5C%5C_Value%7D%7B4096%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2